/*
  WeeklyDigestWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0116 · WeeklyDigestWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `WeeklyDigestWidget` resolves (table "WeeklyDigestWidget") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/WeeklyDigestWidget.tsx) — the title, the four metric
  labels, and the empty-state copy — plus the registry description. The remaining
  keys back the projector's universal delta glyph, the VoiceOver trend phrases, and
  the native-only chrome (freshness chip, refresh/retry/loading/error/banner copy).
*/

/* --- Keys from the web source (parity) --- */
"widget.weeklyDigest.title" = "This Week";
"widget.weeklyDigest.distance" = "Distance";
"widget.weeklyDigest.drives" = "Drives";
"widget.weeklyDigest.energy" = "Energy";
"widget.weeklyDigest.efficiency" = "Efficiency";
